        "text": "Add mcp.webdock.io to Claude, ChatGPT, or Cursor by connecting its remote MCP URL in each client's MCP settings. In Claude, add a custom connector. In ChatGPT, add an MCP app. In Cursor, add an MCP server under Settings. The MCP URL is https://mcp.webdock.io/. This server requires OAuth, so complete the login prompt after you connect."
